## File limits (ESLint enforced)

| Item | Limit |
|------|-------|
| File | 300 lines (target &lt;200) |
| Function | 50 lines, complexity 10 |
| Screen `app/*` | &lt;100 lines — compose only |
| Params | 4 max |
| JSX depth | 4 — extract components |

One component per file. Features: `components/`, `hooks/`, `services/`, `api/`, `types.ts`, `constants.ts`, `index.ts`.

## UI

- Reuse `apps/mobile/src/components/` — no copy-paste between screens.
- Tokens only (Fredoka, Nunito). One primary CTA per screen. No fake press on read-only rows.
- No cross-feature internal imports — shared code in `components/` or `lib/`.
- Phone + tablet parity; same product behaviour on iOS/Android.
- No lorem; use `copy/` or `TODO(spec)`. Prototype copy except D4 banned claims.

Required inventory: see Part B3 in `Dermis_Cursor_Prompt_v3.md`.
